{"metadata":{"externalID":"s:11WorldModule8RelationP","title":"Relation","roleHeading":"Protocol","fragments":[{"text":"protocol","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Relation","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Relation"}],"modules":[{"name":"WorldModule"}],"remoteSource":{"fileName":"Relations.swift","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/ECS\/blob\/main\/Sources\/WorldModule\/Relations.swift#L61"},"symbolKind":"protocol","role":"symbol"},"sections":[],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Relation"},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/worldmodule\/relation"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"relationshipsSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/s16SendableMetatypeP"],"type":"inheritsFrom","kind":"relationships","title":"Inherits From"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/ChildOf"],"type":"conformingTypes","kind":"relationships","title":"Conforming Types"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule"]]},"kind":"symbol","seeAlsoSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Targets","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/CleanupAction"],"title":"Relating Entities","generated":true,"anchor":"Relating-Entities"}],"topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Relation\/isExclusive","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Relation\/onTargetDespawn"],"title":"Type Properties","generated":true,"anchor":"Type-Properties"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A type that describes a kind of link from one entity to others."}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["Linux"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"protocol"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Relation"},{"kind":"text","text":" : "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:s8SendableP","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Sendable"}]}]},{"kind":"mentions","mentions":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/SavingAndLoadingWorlds"]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Overview","anchor":"overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A relation links a "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"source"}]},{"type":"text","text":" entity to one or more "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"target"}]},{"type":"text","text":" entities: a unit likes another,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"a turret is aimed at a ship, a part is a child of its parent ("},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/ChildOf","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"). Declare a relation"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"as a type that conforms to "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Relation"},{"type":"text","text":", then link entities with "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/relate(_:_:to:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":":"}]},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["struct Likes: Relation {}","","var world = World()","let alice = world.spawn(Name(value: \"Alice\"))","let bob = world.spawn(Name(value: \"Bob\"))","world.relate(alice, Likes(), to: bob)","","print(world.targets(Likes.self, of: alice) == [bob])","\/\/ Prints \"true\"","print(world.sources(Likes.self, of: bob) == [alice])","\/\/ Prints \"true\""]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The world stores each link as a pair of a target and a value of the relation, so a relation","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"can carry data about the link:","type":"text"}]},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["struct Owes: Relation { var amount: Int }","","var world = World()","let alice = world.spawn(Name(value: \"Alice\"))","let bob = world.spawn(Name(value: \"Bob\"))","world.relate(alice, Owes(amount: 20), to: bob)","","if let debt = world[Targets<Owes>.self, of: alice][bob] {","    print(debt.amount)","    \/\/ Prints \"20\"","}"]},{"level":3,"type":"heading","text":"Querying Relations","anchor":"Querying-Relations"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"A source holds its pairs of a relation in a ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Targets","type":"reference"},{"text":" component, so you can read and filter","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"on it like any other component. The world also keeps an index of each target’s sources, so","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"filtering a query with ","type":"text"},{"code":".related(_:to:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" visits only the entities related to that target:","type":"text"}]},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["var world = World()","let alice = world.spawn(Name(value: \"Alice\"))","let bob = world.spawn(Name(value: \"Bob\"))","let carol = world.spawn(Name(value: \"Carol\"))","world.relate(alice, Likes(), to: bob)","world.relate(carol, Likes(), to: bob)","","let fans = world.query(Name.self).related(Likes.self, to: bob).map { $0.1.value }","print(fans.sorted())","\/\/ Prints \"[\"Alice\", \"Carol\"]\""]},{"level":3,"type":"heading","text":"Customizing a Relation","anchor":"Customizing-a-Relation"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"By default a source can relate to any number of targets, and despawning a target removes","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"its pairs from the sources. Implement ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Relation\/isExclusive","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" or ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Relation\/onTargetDespawn","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" to change that.","type":"text"}]}]}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"references":{"doc://WorldModule/documentation/WorldModule/SavingAndLoadingWorlds":{"role":"article","kind":"article","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/SavingAndLoadingWorlds","title":"Saving and Loading Worlds","url":"\/documentation\/worldmodule\/savingandloadingworlds","abstract":[{"text":"Save a world’s entities and components, restore them later, and spawn saved groups of entities","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"into other worlds.","type":"text"}]},"doc://WorldModule/documentation/WorldModule/Relation/isExclusive":{"defaultImplementations":1,"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"static","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"isExclusive","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Bool"}],"required":true,"kind":"symbol","title":"isExclusive","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Relation\/isExclusive","url":"\/documentation\/worldmodule\/relation\/isexclusive","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A Boolean value indicating whether a source relates to at most one target."}]},"doc://WorldModule/documentation/WorldModule/ChildOf":{"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"ChildOf"}],"kind":"symbol","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/ChildOf","title":"ChildOf","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"ChildOf"}],"url":"\/documentation\/worldmodule\/childof","abstract":[{"text":"The relation that links a child entity to its parent.","type":"text"}]},"doc://WorldModule/documentation/WorldModule/CleanupAction":{"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"enum"},{"kind":"text","text"